---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const siteUrl = Astro.site ? Astro.site.href.replace(/\/$/, '') : (process.env.SITE_URL || 'https://signal-insight.pages.dev');
const pageUrl = `${siteUrl}/privacy-policy/`;
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | Signal Insight"
  description="Privacy Policy for Signal Insight. Read our transparent policies on data handling, cookies, analytics, and reader privacy protection."
  canonical={pageUrl}
>
  <div class="bg-neutral-50 py-12 sm:py-20 border-b border-neutral-200 dark:bg-[#05070E] dark:border-white/[0.08]">
    <div class="container-narrow">

      <!-- Breadcrumbs -->
      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-8">
        <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-text-muted">
          <li>
            <a href="/" class="transition-colors hover:text-brand-primary">Home</a>
          </li>
          <li aria-hidden="true" class="text-neutral-400">/</li>
          <li class="font-semibold text-text-primary" aria-current="page">Privacy Policy</li>
        </ol>
      </nav>

      <header class="mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-display font-extrabold tracking-tight text-text-primary">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-lead text-text-secondary">Effective Date: November 2026</p>
      </header>

      <div class="prose-editorial max-w-none space-y-8">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-h2 font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">1. Overview &amp; Philosophy</h2>
          <p class="text-text-secondary">
            Signal Insight ("we", "our", or "us") operates as an independent technical publication. We believe privacy is fundamental to open web publishing. We collect minimal telemetry necessary to operate and improve our content.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-h2 font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">2. Analytics &amp; Telemetry</h2>
          <p class="text-text-secondary">
            We prioritize privacy-first analytics tools (such as Plausible Analytics). We do not use cross-site tracking cookies, store personal identifying information, or profile individual readers across other websites.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-h2 font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">3. RSS Syndication &amp; Subscriptions</h2>
          <p class="text-text-secondary">
            Signal Insight publishes content via open RSS 2.0 web feeds (/rss.xml). Reading via RSS transmits zero personal data or tracking cookies to our servers. If you choose to contact our editorial desk via email, your email address is used solely to respond to your specific inquiry. We do not sell subscriber lists, embed hidden tracking pixels, or share reader information with third parties.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-h2 font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">4. Advertising &amp; Third-Party Cookies (Google AdSense)</h2>
          <p class="text-text-secondary mb-3 leading-relaxed">
            Signal Insight works with third-party advertising partners, including Google AdSense, to support our independent publishing. In compliance with Google's advertising policies, we disclose the following practices regarding cookies and personalized ads:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
            <li>
              <strong>Third-Party Cookies:</strong> Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this website or other websites on the Internet.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Personalized Ad Serving:</strong> Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to our users based on their visits to Signal Insight and/or other sites across the web.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong>Opt-Out Mechanism:</strong> You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting Google's <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-primary underline">Ads Settings</a>. Alternatively, you can opt out of a third-party vendor's use of cookies for interest-based advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-primary underline">AboutAds Choices</a>.
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">
            We do not share any personal identifying information (such as your name, email address, or contact messages) with third-party advertisers.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-h2 font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">5. Affiliate Links &amp; External Sites</h2>
          <p class="text-text-secondary">
            Our articles and Tools directory contain outbound partner links (marked with ★). If you click through to an external provider (such as Hetzner, Qdrant, or Cloudflare), that provider processes your visit according to their own privacy policy.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-h2 font-bold text-text-primary mb-4">6. Contact Information</h2>
          <p class="text-text-secondary">
            If you have questions regarding this privacy policy or your data rights, contact us via our <a href="/contact/" class="text-brand-primary underline">Contact &amp; Errata Desk</a> or via our public <a href="https://github.com/Akm4033/signal-insight/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-brand-primary underline">GitHub Issues tracker</a>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
